#### Pitfall 3: Storing Tokens in localStorage (XSS Vulnerability)

**Problem:** Tokens in localStorage accessible to JavaScript, vulnerable to XSS attacks.

**Solution:** Use httpOnly cookies for web apps, encrypted secure storage for mobile.

